<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.5 billion 6-day yields avg 3.242 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.5 billion 6-day yields avg 3.242 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said its C$2.5 billion auction of six-day T-bills due November 4, 1996 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD  PRICE</p>
<p>			  AVG   3.242  99.94674   PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    3.190  99.94759   HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    3.300  99.94578   43.06178</p>
<p>The bills will be dated and issued on October 29, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
